  "description": "The Vaporesso Xros 6 Mini Pod Kit delivers a highly streamlined and portable approach to everyday mouth-to-lung vaping. Built with a slim, ergonomic chassis that fits comfortably into your palm, this compact device houses a substantial 1600mAh internal battery. Engineered for excellent efficiency, the high-capacity cell provides up to 4 days of use on a single charge*, ensuring reliability when you are away from home. When a top-up is required, the 2A Type-C fast-charging system significantly reduces waiting times to keep your device ready for use. Operating entirely via buttonless inhale activation, the Xros 6 Mini offers absolute simplicity without complex screen menus or adjustments. Instead of a display panel, the device incorporates an elegant 5-LED vertical tidal battery indicator, allowing you to monitor your remaining capacity instantly with every puff. Customisation is handled through a precise side airflow slider, enabling users to easily fine-tune their intake from a tight, restricted mouth-to-lung (MTL) draw to a looser, restricted direct-to-lung (RDTL) experience. The kit comes complete with the enhanced 2ml Corex 3.0 mesh pod (0.6ohm), which features a custom morph-mesh structure to promote rapid, even heating and exceptional flavour clarity. This upgraded cartridge includes an innovative 60s Smart Prime function, allowing the coil to fully saturate and prime just one minute after filling to avoid dry hits. Fully cross-compatible with the entire Xros series pod family and reinforced with SSS leak-resistant sealing, this compact kit is ideal for users seeking premium flavour with minimal upkeep. *Battery lifespan is an estimate provided by the manufacturer and will vary depending on individual usage habits. We recommend pairing the included pods with the following E-Liquid: RDL Xros Series 0.6ohm Mesh Pod with 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquid MTL Xros Series 0.8ohm Mesh Pod with 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquid Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
